  exerciseNumber: 06
  exerciseName: InteractPopupWrong
  exerciseTitle: Interact popup wrong
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459442
  exerciseText: Interact Popup is showing up wrong
  hintText: What is the logic for showing the display? Is the boolean logic flipped?
  solutionText: SetActive logic is using == instead of != which means it shows when
    there's nothing to interact and hides when there is something to interact, it
    should be the opposite.
